殺。吏奉厲王詣上，上悔，令呂后母之，而葬厲王母真定。真定，厲王母之家在焉，父世縣也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"淮南厲王長","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"brp_v5i_sjg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"其母","kind":"person","person_id":"kuc_m3w_ux2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0016","start":16,"end":20,"surface":"趙王張敖","kind":"person","person_id":"zs9_uq9_odj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"brp_v5i_sjg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"zs9_uq9_odj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"厲王母","kind":"person","person_id":"kuc_m3w_ux2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"趙王敖","kind":"person","person_id":"zs9_uq9_odj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"貫高","kind":"person","person_id":"v8g_xyw_4v9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0099","start":99,"end":102,"surface":"厲王母","kind":"person","person_id":"kuc_m3w_ux2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"brp_v5i_sjg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0121","start":121,"end":122,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"brp_v5i_sjg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface